OL,3,AMI5 tackling more state threats than
OL,4,Aduring Cold War, warns intelligence
OL,5,Achief
OL,6,
OL,7,FMI5 is devoting more resource to
OL,8,Fcountering state threats than during
OL,9,Fthe Cold War, the head of the
OL,10,Fintelligence service has said, as he
OL,11,Flabelled Russia "aggressor number one".
OL,13,FSir Ken McCallum warned MI5 was now
OL,14,Ffacing a situation in which "our
OL,15,Fterrorism and state threats operational
OL,16,Fmissions are pretty much of equal
OL,17,Fscale" because threats from foreign
OL,18,Fadversaries have quadrupled.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
