OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AMI5 tackling more state threats than
OL,4,Aduring Cold War, warns intelligence
OL,5,Achief
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe used an annual speech at the
OL,8,Fdomestic intelligence service's
OL,9,Fheadquarters in London to also warn of
OL,10,Frising threats from Iran and "extreme
OL,11,Fright-wing terrorism".
OL,13,FSir Ken also said MI5 had "caught
OL,14,Fterrorists seeking to exploit AI",
OL,15,Fincluding by integrating the technology
OL,16,Fwith drones - and warned the UK must
OL,17,Fstay ahead of the risk of new
OL,18,Fbioweapons being developed by violent
OL,19,Fgroups.
